        "# Locale encoding\n",
        "\n",
        "The locale encoding is the encoding associated with the current locale. It can influence default text encoding choices; specify an encoding explicitly when portability matters.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-locale-encoding)"
      ]
    }
